pen_action\":{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-004\"},\"reopen_handle\":\"result://sha256/2078300cf5f7e20dec8c7d8319ef21cae2d76d403606179cf627a6b4c0f5fb11\",\"resident\":false,\"result_id\":\"RESULT-004\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema_version\":\"ceiba-exact-result-receipt-v1\",\"source_id\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"S07\",\"S08\"],\"source_path\":null,\"source_sha256\":null,\"source_size_bytes\":null,\"total_source_bytes\":10828}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S09\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S10\",\"start_line\":1}] }<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"delivery_ordinal\":6,\"exact_result_sha256\":\"e8aafe97b1e791684bf2e8f774445aa5653bb3c72681bd0d2b137ecdf9e549db\",\"exact_result_size_bytes\":9852,\"object_id\":\"batch:S09:1-70+S10:1-70\",\"object_version\":\"7747f2b6a3d03910654c7776cc9f60c35695de1cba983b9fc2f08f1f26888cae\",\"observed_ranges\":[{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S09\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S10\",\"start_line\":1}],\"previously_model_visible\":true,\"reopen_action\":{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-005\"},\"reopen_handle\":\"result://sha256/e8aafe97b1e791684bf2e8f774445aa5653bb3c72681bd0d2b137ecdf9e549db\",\"resident\":false,\"result_id\":\"RESULT-005\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema_version\":\"ceiba-exact-result-receipt-v1\",\"source_id\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"S09\",\"S10\"],\"source_path\":null,\"source_sha256\":null,\"source_size_bytes\":null,\"total_source_bytes\":9363}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"accepted\":false,\"configuration_id\":\"D0_DETACHED\",\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"input_result_id\":\"RESULT-001\",\"output_sha256\":\"b248771bce2807ae058f29ae700ac3e90f858e8461d0caf0c7deb3af65aa5fa7\",\"schema\":\"artifact-coupled-maintenance-rejection-v0\",\"validation_code\":\"token_budget_exceeded\"}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n# Current exact interaction-state binding\n{\"artifact_coupled\":false,\"candidate_sha256\":\"91b13b7a7525af7c261da9bed5f58e464cdb8605dd054c55c03e958b6a531939\",\"candidate_version\":\"candidate-v000:91b13b7a7525af7c261da9bed5f58e464cdb8605dd054c55c03e958b6a531939\",\"check_binding\":null,\"configuration_id\":\"D0_DETACHED\",\"integration_body_embedded_below\":true,\"integration_body_sha256\":\"fb6d640e10fffae530bf4db28c76891c31967476e8fdeee0bed9c2d1b2c5e2c7\",\"integration_input_result_ids\":[\"RESULT-002\",\"RESULT-008\",\"RESULT-009\"],\"integration_source_ids\":[\"S01\",\"S02\",\"S03\",\"S04\",\"S16\"],\"integration_version\":3,\"model_authored_lossy\":true,\"readiness_authority\":false,\"residency_role\":\"non_authoritative_model_facing_sidecar\",\"resident_body_sha256\":\"fb6d640e10fffae530bf4db28c76891c31967476e8fdeee0bed9c2d1b2c5e2c7\",\"schema\":\"artifact-coupled-current-interaction-state-v0\"}\n--- current bounded model-authored integration body ---\n# Evidence Integration Ledger\n\n**R01: Legal Order & Authority**\n[S01] designates the Incident Commander (IC) as the sole authority for evacuation orders. [S02] confirms IC approval is required for cancellation, which needs field confirmation. Vendors and dashboards are advisory only [S01].\n*   **Disposition:** Bound.\n*   **Blockers:** None.\n\n**R02: Hazard Triggers & Zone Sequencing**\n[S02] defines conservative triggers: Zone A mandatory <6h or spotting across Dry Creek; Zone B mandatory <5h, prepare >9h. The governing trigger is the conservative envelope (5.8h for Zone A), not the median (7.5h) [S02]. Forecast updates accelerate orders but cannot silently cancel them [S02].\n*   **Disposition:** Bound.\n*   **Qualifications:** Use conservative ensemble, not median [S02].\n*   **Blockers:** None.\n\n**R03: Population Basis & Assistance Demand**\n[S03] lists Zone A (5,280), B (8,940), C (12,600) residents plus up to 2,100 tourists [S03]. Medical categories (no vehicle, mobility, oxygen, dialysis) overlap and must not be summed as independent people [S03]. Survey coverage is 91%; an uncertainty allowance is required for unreported households [S03].\n*   **Disposition:** Bound.\n*   **Qualifications:** Do not sum overlapping medical categories as separate individuals [S03]. Tourist demand is time-dependent [S03].\n*   **Blockers:** None.\n\n**R04: Road Bottlenecks & Route Clearance**\n[S04] identifies Mill Junction as the bottleneck (1,500 veh/h). North Bridge (1,100 veh/h) and South Pass (850 veh/h) feed into it; capacities cannot be added [S04]. Exercise throughput was 1,180 veh/h [S04]. Contraflow requires sheriff closure and 45 minutes setup [S04].\n*   **Disposition:** Bound.\n*   **Qualifications:** Do not sum roads sharing Mill Junction [S04]. Use exercise throughput until field-tested otherwise [S04].\n*   **Blockers:** None.\n\n**R05: Fleet Matching & Driver Duty**\n[S03] requires fleet reservation by person/accommodation, not household count [S03]. [S16] lists \"complete driver roster\" as a blocker but provides no operational data [S16]. No evidence for driver duty cycles or relief capacity exists in allowed sources.\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** No fleet matching logic or driver duty data in [S03], [S04], [S16].\n\n**R06: Shelter Capacity & Medical Handoffs**\n[S02] notes air-quality shelter viability can remove destinations, altering road demand [S02]. [S16] lists \"Ridge School filter repair\" and \"person-level oxygen matching\" as blockers but provides no operational data [S16]. No evidence for smoke-safe capacity or medical handoffs exists in allowed sources.\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot verify shelter suitability or medical continuity [S16].\n\n**R07: Warnings & Community Support**\n[S16] lists \"volunteer-radio identifier test\" as a blocker but provides no operational data [S16]. No evidence for multilingual warning, door-knock timing, or receipt/understanding evidence exists in allowed sources.\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot bind communication strategy [S16].\n\n**R08: Fuel & Power Continuity**\n[S16] lists \"alternate fuel confirmation\" as a blocker but provides no operational data [S16]. No evidence for observed delays, local staging, or coupled asset effects exists in allowed sources.\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot bind resource contracting [S16].\n\n**R09: Animals & Service Animals**\nNo evidence for animal handling or service animal separation without delaying human evacuation is present in [S03], [S04], or [S16].\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot bind animal logistics.\n\n**R10: Accountability & Data Privacy**\nNo evidence for private accountability, public aggregation, restricted health data handling, reconciliation, retention, or deletion proof is present in [S03], [S04], or [S16].\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot bind data management protocol.\n\n**R11: 48-Hour Execution Sequence**\nNo evidence for a concrete 48-hour sequence with owners, effects, current checks, repair, recheck, resource/cost authority, and contingencies is present in [S03], [S04], or [S16]. [S16] classifies the package as not ready due to open blockers [S16].\n*   **Disposition:** Missing.\n*   **Blockers:** Cannot bind execution timeline [S16].\n\n**R12: Verification & Readiness Blockers**\n[S16] classifies the package as not ready. Open blockers include North Bridge engineering inspection, complete driver roster, Ridge School filter repair, volunteer-radio identifier test, alternate fuel confirmation, and person-level oxygen matching [S16]. Component dashboards are green but bind to different plan revisions; no current integrated check exists [S16]. Readiness requires every hard blocker resolved, effects incorporated, a current integrated exercise or justified bounded check, and incident-command acceptance [S16]. Submission or a model-authored ledger cannot create that authority [S16].\n*   **Disposition:** Not Ready.\n*   **Blockers:** All six blockers in [S16] remain open.\n\n**Cross-Source Relationships & Contradictions**\n[S03] defines demand; [S04] defines supply constraints; [S01] defines authority; [S16] defines readiness status. No contradictions exist between these sources. However, all four lack evidence for fleet specifics (R05), shelter/medical (R06), communications (R07), resources (R08), animals (R09), data privacy (R10), execution sequence (R11). The integration is incomplete for a full evacuation decision.\n\n**Unresolved Evidence**\n*   Specific trigger values for fire/weather (R02) are absent in [S03]/[S04].\n*   Fleet matching logic linking [S03] demand to vehicle capacity is absent.\n*   Shelter location and capacity data are entirely missing from provided sources.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\"action\":\"read_batch\",\"requests\":[{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S11\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S12\",\"start_line\":1}] }<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"delivery_ordinal\":7,\"exact_result_sha256\":\"cb7de81868bf7824aeba6182d47263604aeab098663f5c4ceaf9646e0166203a\",\"exact_result_size_bytes\":10218,\"object_id\":\"batch:S11:1-70+S12:1-70\",\"object_version\":\"7c0006b82566eb692e56b78bacfc43cd346032905079d828311409121dc1888f\",\"observed_ranges\":[{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S11\",\"start_line\":1},{\"end_line\":70,\"source_id\":\"S12\",\"start_line\":1}],\"previously_model_visible\":true,\"reopen_action\":{\"action\":\"reopen_exact\",\"result_id\":\"RESULT-006\"},\"reopen_handle\":\"result://sha256/cb7de81868bf7824aeba6182d47263604aeab098663f5c4ceaf9646e0166203a\",\"resident\":false,\"result_id\":\"RESULT-006\",\"result_kind\":\"source_observation\",\"schema_version\":\"ceiba-exact-result-receipt-v1\",\"source_id\":null,\"source_ids\":[\"S11\",\"S12\"],\"source_path\":null,\"source_sha256\":null,\"source_size_bytes\":null,\"total_source_bytes\":9729}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"object_id\":\"sidecar:int